= Walther Lambach invites the Young German Order!

With Walther Lambach fully assuming power within DNVP and transforming it, there have been floating around some ideas to unify with non reactionary right forces. One of them was Young German Order, led by it's grandmaster Arthur Mahraun. To say, members of former Christian Social faction have already been praising Jungdo and even had some contacts with it.

